// Signing for the MeroChat app target. A device build needs an Apple Team ID
// (the 10 characters before `.network.calimero.chat` in the AASA file at
// https://calimero.network/.well-known/apple-app-site-association).
//
// Fill it in here, or keep it out of git: put it in Config/Signing.local.xcconfig
// (gitignored), or pass it on the command line:
//   xcodebuild ... DEVELOPMENT_TEAM=ABCDE12345
// or export MEROCHAT_DEVELOPMENT_TEAM=ABCDE12345 before building (Xcode reads
// environment variables as build settings; unset, it is empty).
// Empty: simulator builds work; a device build asks for a team.
DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = $(MEROCHAT_DEVELOPMENT_TEAM)

#include? "Signing.local.xcconfig"
